OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in home named as
OL,4,AGP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman found dead at her home has been
OL,7,Fnamed locally as a GP.
OL,9,FThe body of Dr Hannah Terry, also known
OL,10,Fas Hannah Cain, was found at a property
OL,11,Fin Fern Hill, Dersingham, Norfolk, on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FNorfolk Police said it was called to
OL,15,Fthe property by the ambulance service
OL,16,Fjust after 02:20 BST.
OL,18,FA man in his 40s was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of murder and remains in
OL,20,Fcustody.
